.TH DANBY-SLIDINGPENDULUM1 1
.SH NAME
danby-slidingpendulum1 \- pendulum on a freely sliding support
.SH DESCRIPTION
The pivot cart moves without an external horizontal force.  Bob and support
exchange momentum, so the support recoils while the pendulum swings.  The model
uses the coupled nonlinear cart and pendulum equations rather than prescribing
the pivot motion.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
